## CSS
```css
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
  min-height: 100vh;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.snow span {
  position: absolute;
  top: -30px;
  color: #fff;
  font-size: 24px;
  user-select: none;
  /* 每个雪花不同动画时长和延迟 */
  animation: fall 8s linear infinite, sway 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.snow span:nth-child(1) { left: 10%; animation-duration: 7s, 3s; animation-delay: 0s, 0s; }
.snow span:nth-child(2) { left: 25%; animation-duration: 9s, 4s; animation-delay: 1s, 0.5s; font-size: 18px; }
.snow span:nth-child(3) { left: 40%; animation-duration: 6s, 2s; animation-delay: 2s, 1s; font-size: 30px; }
.snow span:nth-child(4) { left: 55%; animation-duration: 8s, 3s; animation-delay: 0.5s, 0.2s; }
.snow span:nth-child(5) { left: 70%; animation-duration: 10s, 4s; animation-delay: 1.5s, 0.8s; font-size: 20px; }
.snow span:nth-child(6) { left: 85%; animation-duration: 7s, 3s; animation-delay: 3s, 1.2s; font-size: 28px; }
.snow span:nth-child(7) { left: 15%; animation-duration: 9s, 5s; animation-delay: 4s, 2s; }
.snow span:nth-child(8) { left: 60%; animation-duration: 6s, 3s; animation-delay: 2.5s, 1.5s; font-size: 22px; }
.snow span:nth-child(9) { left: 90%; animation-duration: 8s, 4s; animation-delay: 5s, 2.5s; font-size: 26px; }

/* 下落动画：从屏幕外落到屏幕外 */
@keyframes fall {
  0%   { transform: translateY(0) rotate(0deg); }
  100% { transform: translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg); }
}
/* 横向摇摆 */
@keyframes sway {
  0%, 100% { margin-left: 0; }
  50%      { margin-left: 30px; }
}
```

