## 思路
`grid-template-areas`让复杂布局可读性极强：用ASCII字符描述区域，元素通过`grid-area`指定区域名。空白用`.`表示。

## HTML
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>杂志布局</title></head>
<body>
  <div class="magazine">
    <div class="banner">📰 杂志标题</div>
    <div class="big">封面大图</div>
    <div class="s1">文章1</div>
    <div class="s2">文章2</div>
    <div class="s3">文章3</div>
    <div class="s4">文章4</div>
    <div class="bottom">底部通栏</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
```

## CSS
```css
body {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 24px;
  background: #f5f5f5;
}
.magazine {
  display: grid;
  /* 3列：分别1fr 1fr 1fr */
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  /* 4行：banner 60px, 主体200px, 主体200px, 底部60px */
  grid-template-rows: 60px 200px 200px 60px;
  gap: 8px;
  /* 命名区域（ASCII画法）：
     "banner banner banner"    banner跨3列
     "big    s1    s2"         big跨2行
     "big    s3    s4"         s1~s4各1格
     "bottom bottom bottom"    bottom跨3列
  */
  grid-template-areas:
    "banner banner banner"
    "big    s1    s2"
    "big    s3    s4"
    "bottom bottom bottom";
}
.magazine > div {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 6px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.banner  { grid-area: banner;  background: #1e3a8a; }
.big     { grid-area: big;     background: #e74c3c; }
.s1      { grid-area: s1;      background: #f39c12; }
.s2      { grid-area: s2;      background: #2ecc71; }
.s3      { grid-area: s3;      background: #9b59b6; }
.s4      { grid-area: s4;      background: #3498db; }
.bottom  { grid-area: bottom;  background: #34495e; }
```

## 思路
Admin布局是Grid的经典应用：2列2行网格，左列固定宽度200px，右列自适应；第一行顶栏，第二行主区。用`grid-column/grid-row`指定元素位置。

